      "message": "`eventsToCRs` can have records but not this event, then `get(event)` returns `null` and the next line throws an `NPE`.\n\nI think this can happen if an old ack is retried while newer events from the same partition are still pending, For example: :\n\n\nevents 1, 2, and 3 are pending.\nAcking event 2 removes events 1 and 2.\nEvent 3 is still in the map.\nIf event 1 is acked again, the map isn\u0027t empty, but `get(event1)` returns `null`, causing an `NPE`.\n\nIt would be good to add a test for that case too.",
